          "conversation_id": "conv_hybrid",
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": "Two sources report that hybrid retrieval (BM25 + dense) beats dense-only retrieval:\n\n- **Santos & Lee (2025)** — hybrid improves top-20 accuracy on **Natural Questions** by 4.1 points [1]\n- **Okafor et al. (2025)** — gains on **Natural Questions** (+3.6) and **TriviaQA** (+2.9), largest on the shifted BEIR subsets [2]\n\nOne source points the other way for multi-hop questions: on **HotpotQA**, a tuned dense-only retriever matches hybrid within 0.5 points [3].",
